          },
          {
            "category": "summary",
            "text": "webkitgtk: A download’s origin may be incorrectly associated",
            "title": "Vulnerability summary"
          },
          {
            "category": "other",
            "text": "To exploit this flaw, an attacker needs to trick a user into visiting a malicious website.",
